The plate spans about 355 px in the image, which I take to be roughly 20-26 cm. At about 24 cm, that gives roughly 0.068 cm per px.

The sausage is about 140 px long, or around 9.5 cm, and about 55 px wide, or around 3.7 cm. Treating it as a cylinder with a radius of about 1.8 cm and a length of 9.5 cm, the volume is π × 3.2 × 9.5, or about 95 cm³. That comes to roughly 90 g, but it looks a bit smaller than that, so I'll say 80 g.

